      "writtenOn": "2026-05-22T18:15:27Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "So this case is interesting, I can\u0027t really keep both. If you look closely, the upstream implementation relies on `exp_info.ops` to be `system_heap_ops` implicitly as it is reusing the setup for the regular \"system\" heap. My idea is to create a separate patch that does our \"system-uncached\" registration first, then the two upstream \"system\" and \"system_cc_shared\" would follow. That way we avoid merge conflicts completely and we avoid the bug of using the wrong ops for cc_shared.",
      "parentUuid": "b264e56b_521b0767",
      "revId": "94ec09a0f12f037b90b0fca0e534a9075b1b8ef2",
